# Raw captures. These are large, they change every week, and every one of them
# can be produced again by the script that wrote it. Only the small reports the
# plan quotes are committed, and they are listed below.
out/*
!out/dry-run.report.json
!out/pdp-sample.json
!out/enumeration.json
!out/endpoints.json
!out/postal-to-region.json
!out/province-price-conflict.json
